  SELECT time_bucket('1 hour'::interval, time, 'Invalid/Timezone'::text) AS bucket,
         tags_id, count(*) AS cnt
  FROM metrics
  GROUP BY bucket, tags_id;
ERROR:  invalid timezone name "Invalid/Timezone"
HINT:  Use a valid timezone name such as 'UTC' or 'Asia/Shanghai'.  A bad name would silently create a CAGG that errors on every REFRESH and every query.
